WEBVTT

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.790
Hurry up, hurry up, we're late!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.550
That's because you were
taking a nap, remember?

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.920
Oh, Rosette

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.930
I'm sorry, Azmaria! We're in
a hurry, so we'll talk later, okay?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:12.190
Sorry for being late. I've brought Chrono.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:24.660
This is the first time
a devil has entered this room.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.920
I wouldn't have called
you here for any other reason.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:36.210
Was there any direct connection
between Lerajie's recent actions...

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.550
...and Aion?

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:46.100
No, this was Lerajie's scheme, and his alone.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.180
All he was planning to do was to absorb

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:51.690
the Astral Line in order
to revive his own power.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.020
Is that so?

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:56.860
Rosette, you've had to recall
a horrible memory, haven't you?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.280
I've never forgotten it!

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:02.870
Aion is the devil that took Joshua away!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.740
I could never forget such a thing!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.460
Thanks to what happened with Azmaria,
the role of the Apostles has been made clear.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.210
If they are able to summon the Astral Line,

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.250
then we can understand why Aion,
who wishes to acquire the power of God,

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:20.050
would take Joshua away.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:24.050
Minister, do you know what Aion's goals are?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.390
Likely a war against Heaven.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:36.610
He is being driven, not by Satan's plans, but
by his own desire to reconstruct the universe.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.610
That is what we have concluded.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.660
For Aion, both Joshua
and Azmaria are absolutely necessary

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.290
for his preparations for this ridiculous war.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.410
Before we were called Sinners,

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:55.290
Aion often used to say

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.420
that the only thing those
marked as imperfect should strive for

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.420
is to become perfect.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:05.590
That he would paint another
conclusion to the Apocalypse.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.270
Another conclusion?!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.480
Upsetting the destinies
of Joshua and everyone else...

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.980
Doing whatever he wants!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.400
The reason I came
here was to look for Joshua!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.820
I've already gained enough
strength to at least fight them!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:26.620
Rosette

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:31.660
Please! Please assign
the mission of finding the Apostles to me!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.170
I told you,that's still under inquiry!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.170
What can you do on your own?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:39.170
Joshua is my younger brother!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.920
That's it! Right now,
you are being too emotional!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.130
If you get carried away by your emotions,

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.970
some day you'll lose sight
even of what you can see!

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:53.270
We are an organization!
You mustn't forget the rules of the group!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.230
We have asked Minister Remington

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.190
to investigate
the Apostles, beginning with Joshua.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:01.570
You will be on common duty for a while.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.900
Cool your head off a little!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.490
Jeez, she is <i>so</i> hard-headed!

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:14.040
What was with that?
She doesn't understand anything!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.460
Wait up, Rosette!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.040
What are you doing? Hurry up!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.500
Hey, Rosette?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.090
Oh, I'm sorry, my mistake.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.430
What was it?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.350
You and Chrono are always busy.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:42.020
That's because the devils
are always causing trouble.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.980
How's the choir?

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.280
Oh, it's so much fun!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.950
This time, I have a solo part!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.990
Thank goodness that you've cheered up.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.410
You've got a good smile now.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:57.620
Yes! It's thanks to both of you!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:01.460
I've changed a lot since I came here myself.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.460
I've learned a lot of different things.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:08.220
For me, this place is kind of like a school.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.100
But there's nothing left
for me to learn here anymore!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.600
I'm going to leave!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.890
What?!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.100
Didn't Sister Kate say that I would stop
being able to see even what I can see?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.400
If I stay here, I'll stop being able to see!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.940
It's no use trying to stop me!
I'm going to go find Joshua!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.660
Are you all right, Rosette?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.960
Chrono, we're going!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.420
R-Right now?

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.380
Of course! It's good to hurry
when there's something worth doing!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.260
I'm going to get out of here as fast as I can.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:03.270
I really do think this is a bad idea, Rosette!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.940
It's fine! Once I've decided,
I don't change my mind.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.780
What did you decide?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.870
Minister Remington!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:16.330
I thought you might come here.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.040
I'm sorry, Minister, but I...

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.830
I've got to look for Joshua, no matter what!

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.500
Have you ever
considered applying to the Militia?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.460
The Militia... the First Class?!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:32.510
That's right. There are several
privileges granted to this Class.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:35.390
One of them is the right to
pursue independent investigations.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:40.680
Some among them have been investigating
a single case for a great deal of time.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.770
It's perfect for you right now.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.610
But how?

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.360
The main thing is to convince Sister Kate,

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.530
with your own abilities.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.530
I see, with my own abilities!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.200
What? Do you have a problem with that?

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.160
No, none at all.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.330
Here you are.
I put in a lot of milk and sugar.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.370
Thank you.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.210
It's delicious.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.380
Isn't it?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:13.260
It's made from high-quality
leaves that I received as a special gift.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.840
Now then, what do you wish to discuss?

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.720
You won't laugh at me?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:23.810
It's all right, listening to the problems
of other people is also our work.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.360
I want to be like Rosette!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:33.700
I want to become a distinguished
exorcist like her, and help people in trouble!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.030
Is that strange?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:41.410
For me, to allow someone
to emulate that is a little...

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:47.250
I hated this power. I even hated myself.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.500
I always made
the people around me unhappy.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:51.710
But...

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.430
Rosette never gave up.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:04.480
I never want to give up again!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.940
I want to do something for somebody!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.440
Azmaria...

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.780
Spiritual power maintenance equipment
is regulating this room's temperature,

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.660
so it might be a little cold.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.370
Rosette did her training here too.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.420
This is...

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:34.510
This is an energy
formation field that Elder invented,

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:37.510
using mock spirit form containment units.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:40.390
To put it simply,
this is an exorcist training area.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:43.970
The targets are
artificial poltergeists, so to speak.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:48.480
It is possible to simulate
indoor conditions, outdoor conditions,

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.520
and battles with monsters in any situation.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:52.820
Monsters?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.820
Relax, this place is used
to focus spiritual energy.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:00.490
We wouldn't throw all that at a beginner.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.120
Well, then, please go downstairs and wait.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.660
I will give you further
directions from the control room.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.830
Yes, Ma'am.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:15.760
Doesn't it bring back
memories of when we came here?

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.340
Are you finished preparing?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.760
Yes.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.810
In addition, Chrono will stay here.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.060
What?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.890
No "what" about it.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.100
If you went with her,
then it wouldn't be much of a test.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:33.520
Now, Rosette,
please hand over that watch too.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.740
Say, where's Sister Kate?

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.110
I'll call her after we've started.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.280
Retroactive approval?

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:47.290
If we can get results, then afterwards,
I'll find some way to explain it to her.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.590
Rosette, are you ready?

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.050
Yes, please begin at any time.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.630
Level twenty, the one used
for the highest class people.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.050
Roger.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.010
Beginning formation
of the spiritual energy field.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:09.480
Release the targets.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.400
Beginning recording.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:20.990
The qualifying goal is the extermination
of all targets within one hour.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.830
Well then, I wish you good luck.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:27.830
Roger.

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.750
A powerful, evil intent?!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.420
Oh,that.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:40.300
Actually, I released a monster down there.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:44.010
One of the powerful evil spirits that
we had sealed away in the storage area.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.350
N-No way!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.020
Well, she has to see what she's
set out to do through to the end.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.270
If she can't clear this easily,

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.310
she won't be able to convince Sister Kate.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.520
What did you say just now?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:58.650
Hi!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.740
Exactly what is going on?!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.910
Sister Kate? Where are you?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.230
Rosette, can you hear me?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.240
Yes!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.280
There's been an accident.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:27.240
I'm sorry, but the test has to be stopped.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:30.870
What?! Why's that?
Please tell me the reason!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:35.160
Azmaria is down there,
and we can't contact her.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.750
Azmaria?!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.210
And furthermore, unfortunately,
there's a devil down there too.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.040
What?! Why?!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.050
Well, sorry.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.090
I released it in order
to test your strength,

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.630
but I never thought there
would be someone here before you.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.600
You were the ones using this place
without permission to begin with!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.640
Sister Kate?!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:56.390
Rosette! Leave everything
else to us and come back.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.440
You understand, right?

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.810
But Azmaria!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:03.440
It's all right. We'll rescue
her immediately, so rest easy.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.360
You understand, right, Rosette?

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.200
Minister Remington...

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.370
Please.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:17.000
Let me go rescue Azmaria!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.620
What are you saying?!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.500
Rosette, we're dealing
with a mind eater here.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:25.010
It possesses people, reads
their memories, and impersonates them.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:30.090
This one caused over fifty
indiscriminate murders during the Civil War.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.430
This is not an opponent that you can handle!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.100
Leave this to the Militia!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.270
But...

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.690
Rosette? Rosette!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.190
What's wrong, Rosette? Answer me!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.740
Minister? Minister Remington?!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.050
Don't scare me like that, Azmaria.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:19.730
Rosette!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.490
This body possesses wonderful power.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.340
Azmaria! Get a hold of yourself!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.010
Azmaria! Azmaria!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.040
I'm going!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.210
Wait!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.540
Minister Remington...

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.050
Are you going to just stand by
and watch the two of them get killed?!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.090
This is the moment of truth for Rosette.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.220
At a time like this...

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.970
What are you saying?!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:39.220
That thing consumes people's hearts!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.930
If you save her this time,
it will all have been for nothing.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:49.440
Under the current conditions,
there is only one way for her to cope.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:53.740
Do you mean diving into
her soul, and directly exorcising it?

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.120
This has become a harsh trial for Rosette.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.750
After all, not everything can
be solved by pulling a trigger.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.250
If the worst should happen, I'm going!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:15.970
All I can do is pray that Azmaria's effect on
causality does not influence Rosette as well.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.140
Causality...

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.810
To be honest, I'm not very good at diving.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.770
Here I go!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.080
Azmaria! Look over here, Azmaria!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.620
At this rate, your soul
is going to get taken over!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.080
It's no use!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.210
Mind eater!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:57.180
That child will never move.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.470
Whose graves do you think those are?

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.640
Her father's and her mother's,

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.270
the members of
the orchestra that took care of her.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.640
Her power called forth
the death of all of them.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:12.730
God has entrusted her
with power, yet her heart is full of fear.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.030
Azmaria...

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:21.450
Those entrusted with the power of God
are always burdened with a great causality.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.950
Just like our Lord was.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:29.000
They are considered eerie
by those who are ignorant.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:32.130
When they finally
find peace, it is taken away.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:33.550
I can hear her.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:36.510
"If only I didn't have this power..."

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:38.930
Joshua...

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:46.060
Loneliness, anxiety, fear,
and more than anything else, power!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:51.100
Quite a comfortable place, this is.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:55.530
Shut up, you! I have
business with the Azmaria over there!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.370
What is this?!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:07.830
Azmaria, can you hear me?!
Even I have a lot of things that scare me!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.920
But if you worry about them
by yourself, nothing will get solved!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.880
You're the one that needs to shut up!

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:23.760
Listen to me, Azmaria!
Don't be afraid of your power!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.020
You have to fight! You're not alone!

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:30.640
I'm here! And Chrono is too!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.560
We're by your side, so...

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:37.940
Shut up!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:41.990
The important thing is knowing fear,

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:46.530
but taking a step forward anyways!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.290
Rosette!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:55.250
No! Don't take Rosette away!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.400
Rosette! Rosette!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.200
Chrono...

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.960
Man, I can't believe that
you actually fought with causality.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.380
Chrono, where's Azmaria?

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.720
Azmaria...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.230
Thank you, Rosette.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:58.150
Just then, I think I saw it.

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:01.280
Yeah, I saw it too.
